{"title":"Skeleton Knight","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 40 Skeleton that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">shock</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (3.8% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/grave-rivet\">Grave Rivet</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton-knight\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton-knight?lv=38\">Lv 38 <span>70</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton-knight?lv=39\">Lv 39 <span>74</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton-knight?lv=40\">Lv 40 <span>79</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton-knight?lv=41\">Lv 41 <span>76</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton-knight?lv=42\">Lv 42 <span>27</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/skeleton-knight?lv=38\" title=\"Pick level 38\"><td><b>38</b></td><td>176</td><td>25.4</td><td>1,900</td><td class=\"muted\">528 · 35.6 · 5,700</td><td>70</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/skeleton-knight?lv=39\" title=\"Pick level 39\"><td><b>39</b></td><td>185</td><td>26</td><td>1,950</td><td class=\"muted\">555 · 36.4 · 5,850</td><td>74</td><td>in the wilds around 1467, 1086</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/skeleton-knight?lv=40\" title=\"Pick level 40\"><td><b>40</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>194</td><td>26.5</td><td>2,000</td><td class=\"muted\">582 · 37.1 · 6,000</td><td>79</td><td>in the wilds around 1452, 1098</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/skeleton-knight\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>41</b></td><td>203</td><td>27.1</td><td>2,050</td><td class=\"muted\">609 · 37.9 · 6,150</td><td>76</td><td>in the wilds around 1459, 1097</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/skeleton-knight?lv=42\" title=\"Pick level 42\"><td><b>42</b></td><td>212</td><td>27.6</td><td>2,100</td><td class=\"muted\">636 · 38.6 · 6,300</td><td>27</td><td>in the wilds around 1449, 1108</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"skeleton-knight\" data-map-level=\"41\">Show level 41 on the map</button>\n      <h2>Appearance</h2><p class=\"s muted\">How the game draws it. Archers and mages wear better armor as their level goes up.</p><div class=\"look-grid\"><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/735a78a50619fe3c3bf4.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Plain</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/9942d111fe473b4b38d7.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Archer</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 25–44 · Werewolfpelt armor</div></div></div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 13 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 165 recorded drops, 9,892 total, 23–250 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×23–250</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"health-potion-large\" title=\"Health Potion Large - in 3 of 13 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 3 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/752437a6ecea30afa5ec.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bolt\" title=\"Bolt - in 2 of 13 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 14 total, 6–8 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b4362887a1f8d7b3462f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bolt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/7<br>×6–8</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"arrow\" title=\"Arrow - in 2 of 13 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 9 total, 3–6 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f8e0f872cc502e1dabe7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Arrow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/7<br>×3–6</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+6 more\">+6 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-potion-large\" title=\"Mana Potion Large - in 2 of 13 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4a127458a5f5f489058.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mana Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/7<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-large\" title=\"Stamina Potion Large - in 2 of 13 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7fdf25f5efb0344b88a4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/7<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-shield\" title=\"Gold Shield - in 1 of 13 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a011baeea0e0c4dcdb3b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Shield</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/13<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Good: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-kryss\" title=\"Gold Kryss - in 1 of 13 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f34cb12d01760f5e9019.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Kryss</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/13<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ogrewax-arms\" title=\"Ogrewax Arms - in 1 of 13 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/dc8e655dbf47607bb61d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogrewax Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/13<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Good: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gem-pearl\" title=\"Gem Pearl - in 1 of 13 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a8e7d0e0c97b577cea1a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gem Pearl</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/13<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Mirewatch Crypt</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 266</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-223\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-1938.1px,-4048.5px)\"><img src=\"tiles/5/6/15.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1536px;top:3840px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/6/16.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1536px;top:4096px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/7/15.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1792px;top:3840px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/7/16.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1792px;top:4096px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/8/15.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:2048px;top:3840px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/8/16.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:2048px;top:4096px\"><i style=\"left:1994.7px;top:4047.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:1943.3px;top:3996.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:1924.9px;top:3987.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:2084.3px;top:4013.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:2002.8px;top:4037.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:1930.0px;top:4044.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:1873.4px;top:4070.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:1897.5px;top:4055.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:1935.4px;top:4036.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:1932.7px;top:4048.5px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 1457, 1096 <span class=\"muted\">· 7 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Thak%20Muster%20Ground\">Old Thak Muster Ground</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"skeleton-knight\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Skeleton: <a href=\"#/monster/skeleton\">Skeleton</a> <span class=\"muted\">(7)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/drowned-crewman\">Drowned Crewman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(15)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/stoneborn\">Stoneborn</a> <span class=\"muted\">(22)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/skeleton-man-at-arms\">Skeleton Man-at-Arms</a> <span class=\"muted\">(36)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/grave-knight\">Grave Knight</a> <span class=\"muted\">(44)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/knight-commander\">Knight-Commander</a> <span class=\"muted\">(47)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/virikh\">Virikh</a> <span class=\"muted\">(50)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar\">Virikh Templar</a> <span class=\"muted\">(53)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/virikh-lord\">Virikh Lord</a> <span class=\"muted\">(56)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/virikh-dragonslayer\">Virikh Dragonslayer</a> <span class=\"muted\">(58)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/9942d111fe473b4b38d7.webp\" alt=\"Skeleton Knight\"></div><h3>Skeleton Knight</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>41</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 40)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Skeleton</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>stab · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>203</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>27.1</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2,050</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.1 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>26 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}